== Effects ==
* Reveals the locations and types of all special rooms on the map, except {{r|Secret Room}}s and {{r|Super Secret Room}}s.

== Notes ==
* The following rooms will be revealed if they exist:{{column list | width = 15em | content =
** {{r|Arcade}}
** {{r|Boss Challenge Room}}
** {{r|Boss Room}}
** {{r|Challenge Room}}
** {{r|Clean Bedroom}}
** {{r|Curse Room}}
** {{r|Dice Room}}
** {{r|Dirty Bedroom}}
** {{r|Library}}
** {{r|Mini-Boss Room}}
** {{r|Planetarium}}
** {{r|Sacrifice Room}}
** {{r|Shop}}
** {{r|Treasure Room}}
** {{r|Vault}}
}}
* When combined with {{i|Blue Map}} and {{i|Treasure Map}}, the entire floor is revealed, identical to the effect of {{i|The Mind}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Book of Secrets|r}}: It is easier to gain {{i|X-Ray Vision}} as Book of Secrets cannot give a mapping effect Isaac already has.

