== Trivia ==
* The compass icon is the same as the one from the the game ''[[wikipedia:The Legend of Zelda (video game)|The Legend of Zelda]]''.
* This item is used in {{chal|Cursed!}}.
* {{dlc|r}} Under the minimap, {{i|The Mind}}'s icon will override the icon of this item.
* This item can be found as one of the Nintendo-themed {{r|Treasure Room}} items in the 6th of December's [[List of curated daily challenges|Daily Run]], which is an homage to the late CEO of Nintendo, Satoru Iwata.

